<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>Feel Special</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">TWICE</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">Feel Special</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">3Hz3tTQwOdM6XkA0ALB2G9</ttm:item>
      <itunes:duration>03:27.000</itunes:duration>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:14.170" end="00:16.360" ttm:agent="v1">그런 날이 있어</p>
      <p begin="00:16.360" end="00:19.960" ttm:agent="v1">갑자기 혼자인 것만 같은 날</p>
      <p begin="00:19.960" end="00:24.260" ttm:agent="v1">어딜 가도 내 자리가 아닌 것만 같고</p>
      <p begin="00:24.260" end="00:28.450" ttm:agent="v1">고갠 떨궈지는 날</p>
      <p begin="00:28.450" end="00:30.660" ttm:agent="v1">그럴 때마다 내게</p>
      <p begin="00:30.660" end="00:33.820" ttm:agent="v1">얼마나 내가 소중한지</p>
      <p begin="00:33.820" end="00:38.090" ttm:agent="v1">말해주는 너의 그 한마디에</p>
      <p begin="00:38.090" end="00:39.940" ttm:agent="v1">Everything's alright</p>
      <p begin="00:39.940" end="00:43.350" ttm:agent="v1">초라한 Nobody 에서 다시 Somebody</p>
      <p begin="00:43.350" end="00:45.640" ttm:agent="v1">특별한 나로 변해</p>
      <p begin="00:45.640" end="00:48.380" ttm:agent="v1">You make me feel special</p>
      <p begin="00:48.380" end="00:52.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">세상이 아무리 날 주저앉혀도 (앉혀도)</p>
      <p begin="00:52.130" end="00:55.520" ttm:agent="v1">아프고 아픈 말들이 날 찔러도</p>
      <p begin="00:55.520" end="00:58.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">네가 있어 난 다시 웃어 (다시 웃어)</p>
      <p begin="00:58.740" end="01:00.500" ttm:agent="v1">That's what you do</p>
      <p begin="01:00.500" end="01:03.380" ttm:agent="v1">Again, I feel special</p>
      <p begin="01:03.380" end="01:06.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">아무것도 아닌 존재 같다가도 (같다가도)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.970" end="01:10.430" ttm:agent="v1">사라져도 모를 사람 같다가도</p>
      <p begin="01:10.430" end="01:13.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">날 부르는 네 목소리에 (소리에)</p>
      <p begin="01:13.530" end="01:18.620" ttm:agent="v1">I feel loved, I feel so special</p>
      <p begin="01:18.620" end="01:22.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">자꾸 숨고만 싶어서 (Hey)</p>
      <p begin="01:22.510" end="01:25.390" ttm:agent="v1">마주 하기가 싫어서</p>
      <p begin="01:25.390" end="01:27.510" ttm:agent="v1">모든 게 의미를 잃은 듯이</p>
      <p begin="01:27.510" end="01:29.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">내가 의미를 잃은 듯이 (Hey)</p>
      <p begin="01:29.630" end="01:33.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">가만히 주저앉아 있을 때 (Ahh)</p>
      <p begin="01:33.970" end="01:37.750" ttm:agent="v1">그때 내 앞에 나타난 너의</p>
      <p begin="01:37.750" end="01:41.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">따뜻한 미소와 손길에 (Hey)</p>
      <p begin="01:41.320" end="01:43.220" ttm:agent="v1">Everything's alright</p>
      <p begin="01:43.220" end="01:46.680" ttm:agent="v1">초라한 Nobody 에서 다시 Somebody</p>
      <p begin="01:46.680" end="01:48.990" ttm:agent="v1">특별한 나로 변해</p>
      <p begin="01:48.990" end="01:51.600" ttm:agent="v1">You make me feel special</p>
      <p begin="01:51.600" end="01:55.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">세상이 아무리 날 주저앉혀도 (앉혀도)</p>
      <p begin="01:55.330" end="01:58.860" ttm:agent="v1">아프고 아픈 말들이 날 찔러도</p>
      <p begin="01:58.860" end="02:01.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">네가 있어 난 다시 웃어 (다시 웃어)</p>
      <p begin="02:01.960" end="02:03.890" ttm:agent="v1">That's what you do</p>
      <p begin="02:03.890" end="02:06.620" ttm:agent="v1">Again, I feel special</p>
      <p begin="02:06.620" end="02:10.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">아무것도 아닌 존재 같다가도 (같다가도)</p>
      <p begin="02:10.180" end="02:13.690" ttm:agent="v1">사라져도 모를 사람 같다가도</p>
      <p begin="02:13.690" end="02:16.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">날 부르는 네 목소리에 (소리에)</p>
      <p begin="02:16.860" end="02:21.340" ttm:agent="v1">I feel loved, I feel so special</p>
      <p begin="02:21.340" end="02:24.330" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, you make everything alright</p>
      <p begin="02:24.330" end="02:27.940" ttm:agent="v1">구름이 쫙 낀 햇살 한 줌 없는 날</p>
      <p begin="02:27.940" end="02:29.870" ttm:agent="v1">네가 바로 나의 Shining light</p>
      <p begin="02:29.870" end="02:31.370" ttm:agent="v1">That's what you do</p>
      <p begin="02:31.350" end="02:33.590" ttm:agent="v1">아무리 어두운 밤도 다시 낮</p>
      <p begin="02:33.590" end="02:35.090" ttm:agent="v1">I owe it to you</p>
      <p begin="02:34.980" end="02:36.480" ttm:agent="v1">Because you make me feel</p>
      <p begin="02:36.330" end="02:38.260" ttm:agent="v1">You make me feel special</p>
      <p begin="02:38.260" end="02:41.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">세상이 아무리 날 주저앉혀도 (앉혀도)</p>
      <p begin="02:41.910" end="02:45.370" ttm:agent="v1">아프고 아픈 말들이 날 찔러도</p>
      <p begin="02:45.370" end="02:48.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">네가 있어 난 다시 웃어 (다시 웃어)</p>
      <p begin="02:48.580" end="02:50.410" ttm:agent="v1">That's what you do</p>
      <p begin="02:50.410" end="02:53.170" ttm:agent="v1">Again, I feel special</p>
      <p begin="02:53.170" end="02:56.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">아무것도 아닌 존재 같다가도 (같다가도)</p>
      <p begin="02:56.800" end="03:00.250" ttm:agent="v1">사라져도 모를 사람 같다가도</p>
      <p begin="03:00.250" end="03:03.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">날 부르는 네 목소리에 (소리에)</p>
      <p begin="03:03.440" end="03:08.690" ttm:agent="v1">I feel loved, I feel so special</p>
      <p begin="03:08.690" end="03:12.850" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="03:12.850" end="03:18.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I feel so special)</p>
      <p begin="03:18.370" end="03:22.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I feel loved, I feel so special)</p>
      <p begin="03:22.370" end="03:26.370" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
  </body>
